Define the confidence of a labelled instance $(D,Q,A,\hat{E})$ as

$$
\begin{array}{l} c (D, Q, A, \hat {E}) = \exp (- L _ {A} (D, Q, A)) * \\ \exp (- L _ {E} (D, Q, \hat {E})). \\ \end{array}
